        "language": "english",
        "review": "Been following this dude on YouTube for a long time. I had no idea he made this game and just discovered it two days ago. It's pretty damn cool and runs well (even on Deck; played for almost an hour and a half my first session and the battery only went down from 89% to 71%. Solid 60FPS. Amazing music, fun sounds, great art style, engaging gameplay and upgrade path. A real gem, especially if you're a musician or synth-freak. Another good one to check out is Rogue Voltage.",
